7568,-0.07484106719493866,-0.007084941491484642,0.010602143593132496,0.04405497759580612,-0.038586098700761795],"metadata":{"id":"4c5f6a45-177a-4695-9201-ae678899b709","url":"file:///app/collector/hotdir/password_migration_tools.md","title":"password_migration_tools.md","docAuthor":"Unknown","description":"Unknown","docSource":"a text file uploaded by the user.","chunkSource":"","published":"7/4/2025, 6:37:20 AM","wordCount":74,"token_count_estimate":161,"text":"<document_metadata>\nsourceDocument: password_migration_tools.md\npublished: 7/4/2025, 6:37:20 AM\n</document_metadata>\n\n# Password Migration Tools\n\n## 1Password to Pass Migration\n- Using 1password2pass.rb script from password-store repository\n- Source: https://git.zx2c4.com/password-store/tree/contrib/importers/1password2pass.rb\n\n### Key Script Options:\n- `-f` (--force): Overwrite existing passwords\n- `-d` (--default [FOLDER]): Place passwords into specific folder\n- `-n` (--name [PASS-NAME]): Select field to use as pass-name (title or URL)\n- `-m` (--meta): Import metadata and insert it below the password\n\n### Prerequisites:\n- Requires both `pass` and Ruby installed\n- GPG key setup required\n- Requires 1Password export in either .1pif or CSV format"}}]]